## Interface: 16001
## Title: BetterBuffsForever
## Notes: A buff check on WoW Forever for druids, paladins and shamans: a box at the top centre lists who lacks your buff (Mark of the Wild and Thorns; blessings by class, no aura, Righteous Fury when tanking; weapon imbue and Lightning Shield) and low reagents. Click a name to buff it. Hidden in combat. Druids, shamans, priests, paladins and mages also get a dispel panel by class (druid curses and poisons; shaman poisons and diseases; priest magic and diseases; paladin Cleanse/Purify; mage curses), with one click button per member in combat. /bbuff
